    "Cold rollout kept all Ingress, HTTPRoute, and Gateway UIDs and generations unchanged; doctor reported complete and healthy after the 120-second observation.",
    "Startup resource collection retained one vanished hook cgroup and two not-yet-addressable controller proxy errors. The post-rollout window had no collection errors.",
    "The legacy TestScale field controller_rss_bytes reports working set; controller_memory_rss_bytes is resident memory.",
    "Churn used the end-to-end fixture: controller limits 4 CPU and 1Gi memory, requests 100m CPU and 128Mi memory, DEBUG logging. Its resource window includes startup and teardown, not only the five-minute churn phase."
